Upstream: https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-tck
License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Kestrel-maintained A2A 1.0.1 conformance runner corrections.
SOURCE.toml identifies the public base, pinned specification and complete
source/test patch. UPSTREAM.patch preserves the complete changes.
This is not an unmodified upstream TCK or an upstream compatibility certification.

Corrections include native error identity and normative levels, explicit
implementor HTTP authentication, required Message fields in every container,
active-task subscription prerequisites, regenerated reference scenarios,
selected-interface tenant routing and unique per-probe message identities.
